SSS
VERSION 1.1
STANDARD NAMES
SURVEY
TITLE "Typed response codes"
RECORD A
VARIABLE 1
NAME "INTEGER"
LABEL "Integer response"
TYPE SINGLE
POSITION 1
VALUES
1 TO 5 WITH
9 "Unknown"
END VALUES
END VARIABLE
VARIABLE 2
NAME "QUANTITY"
LABEL "Quantity response"
TYPE QUANTITY
POSITION 2 TO 8
VALUES
-12.5 TO 25.5 WITH
-99.5 "Missing"
999.25 "Unknown"
END VALUES
END VARIABLE
END RECORD
END SURVEY
END SSS
